  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your cards close but the Joker accessible. If you show a 'tell' that a card is the Joker (like a slight flinch or a smirk), you'll never get rid of it.\n\nThe 'Lure': When someone draws from you, push your most useless non-matching card forward. If they take it, they haven't won anything. If they hesitate, they might suspect it's the Joker and pick a different cardâ€”which IS the Joker.\n\nCard Tracking: With fewer players, remember which ranks have already been paired and discarded. This tells you which cards in your hand are 'guaranteed pairs' (cards that haven't appeared in the discard pile yet).",
